/-
  Audit/KFCausalHolonomyBornProjectiveGrowth.lean

  BORN-COMPLETE PROJECTIVE CAUSAL HOLONOMY GROWTH

  This module promotes the finite causal-holonomy interference law to a
  microscopic operator process over arbitrary finite depth.

  Two projectivity laws are proved.  Kraus completeness gives the partial-
  trace law, in which an unobserved next record is summed with the SAME
  outcome on the ket and bra sides:

      sum_e D(e :: h, e :: k) = D(h,k).

  The special causal-holonomy operators also sum coherently to identity.
  Therefore they satisfy the stronger quantum-measure cylinder law obtained
  by independently summing every future ket and bra branch.  The same finite
  law is consequently both Born complete and exhaustively projective.

  Zero sorry. Zero custom axioms.
-/

